{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "3e79185f3b38af16f1050b8c4dcc19f9afd704c9a1e7903055d1050573296406", "ja": "あ、やっぱりこちらにいたんですね。\n{$P$}、お疲れ様です。", "zh": "啊，果然在这里呢。\n{$P$}先生，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7d875c330a04f61316f8dc84442c4c27b8e9180669e24a2cad96656de04d1575", "ja": "千早じゃないか、お疲れ様。\nあれ……でも今日はオフだったよな？", "zh": "这不是千早吗，辛苦了。\n咦……不过你今天不是休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "18f19350664ac85ae6147a9541c4dcf12cb746a2da302c5258f1416fcbead22b", "ja": "劇場で春香と待ち合わせをしていたので、\n{$P$}にも挨拶をと思って。", "zh": "我和春香约好了在剧场见面，所以也想来跟{$P$}打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e81beb507f8206d3185314c593e987e2f065fccd1425f125b5fcfc38df00671a", "ja": "そうだったのか。わざわざありがとうな。\n春香と待ち合わせって、一緒に遊びにでも行くのか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。还特意来打招呼，谢谢你了。  \n你和春香约好见面，是要一起出去玩什么的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "6ad2b6cf69bf49740d77a9b6364037d7278c6f85f62543cf2e89fc863b289ed8", "ja": "はい。といっても近くの公園ですが。\n今日はカメラの練習に付き合ってもらう予定なんです。", "zh": "是的。不过只是附近的公园。\n今天打算请她陪我练习拍照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "5eb334a2183f94e21a5f92dd6222ebe0d62b09a2a4c4421586b31503aab38e07", "ja": "もっと人を撮る練習もしてみたいと春香に話したら、\n協力すると言ってくれて。", "zh": "我跟春香说过，想多练习拍摄人物，她说愿意帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7e85d7f9f873a58c45850b763defee2e8fed4866b206841fd753a99b312c4274", "ja": "なるほど。そういえばさっき春香を見かけたけど、\nずいぶんオシャレしてたのは、それが理由か。", "zh": "原来如此。说起来，刚才我看到春香了，她打扮得特别时髦，原来是因为这个啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d1d250a8e2b07ffbaaa1c82b0a1d2cd6145b6971e6fab1995fcab1d8f9f96288", "ja": "って、そういえば千早も今日は一段と\nオシャレしてるな。一緒に写るのか？", "zh": "这么说来，千早今天也格外打扮得漂亮啊。你们要一起合影吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "79c41dc04ea0a9778b71ef4717c8ebfb1df447e98e28ef0ab0191bd67e6eb59b", "ja": "あ、はい。一応……。\n春香に、せっかくだから一緒に撮ろうと誘われて。", "zh": "啊，好的。姑且算是吧……\n春香说难得有这个机会，就邀请我一起拍照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "1b792c29b3cd6ebb42cee622fa8efb44f7b01e7e8fdf8b096e16427c1c8a51d6", "ja": "家を出る直前に、急にそういう連絡が入ったので、\n慌てて着替えて、準備しました。", "zh": "就在要出门前，突然收到了那样的联络，\n于是手忙脚乱地换了衣服，做好了准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1010_p", "source_sha256": "30d3a9c4b152b1e994585a44d36f5f192104c0cfdb828fff3ce1927bec108766", "ja": "はは、それは想定外だったな。\nでもバッチリ決まってると思うぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，那还真是出乎意料啊。\n不过我觉得你这身打扮非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "a06eb54410c5d770a267acdd7d1a0fd9d7237cc5e8124a855d291e4d43a70e7f", "ja": "そ、そうですか？", "zh": "是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc07f191b2cb9783a1a156ed1e8e0c2d6db2988bf16b2d4008871cc02bb0eabc", "ja": "ああ。千早らしい落ち着いた雰囲気だけど、\nいつもと違う感じもあって。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。虽然是千早一贯沉稳的感觉，但也有种和平时不一样的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ef5e5e9fc7a60c4a025fe719d14ede64766bd25aebabde35f3d96bd0636b5297", "ja": "髪型のアレンジも、その服によく合ってると思う。\nいい写真が撮れそうだな！", "zh": "发型的搭配也很适合那身衣服。\n我觉得应该能拍出很棒的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "5afc41dbc39039e3fad935a22772127fbdabf7a69b9e690da3c09ec28baec7e3", "ja": "ありがとうございます。そんな風に褒めて\nいただけるとは思っていなかったのですが。", "zh": "谢谢您。我没想到\n能得到您这样的夸奖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "c3a41af339717b11cffd4dc3172cedde1b07d78737d0ad41f4395b0c51de087c", "ja": "けど、安心しました。春香には「オシャレしてきて」\nと言われていたんですが、少し不安だったので。", "zh": "不过，这样我就放心了。春香让我“打扮得时髦一点”再来，可我还是有点不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0f8b6959372f044a7a013738d866bc32ac7c074066f1770f87ac4c071f09c67e", "ja": "そこは自信もって大丈夫！　……そうだ。\n今日撮る写真、後で見せてもらうことできるか？", "zh": "这点尽管自信就好！……对了。\n今天拍的照片，之后能给我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "e7fb48029cd36d41c4edc0a3535d86f998be1837fbe794020b02d06e2d4ddd1c", "ja": "えっ、構いませんけど……普通の写真ですよ？\nそれでもよければ。", "zh": "咦，可以是可以……但就是普通的照片哦？\n如果这样也没关系的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1018_p", "source_sha256": "36d1efa7a09d499b17abba02f699b0f1e36fc1eec1abe5778da61d64d10dcd57", "ja": "ありがとう。話を聞いてたら、どんな写真が\n出来上がるのか、ぜひ見てみたいと思ってな。", "zh": "谢谢。听你这么一说，我很想看看最后能拍出什么样的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "3e390f1b5884b219ee6e5a800ffdeea47a41ddc706d93a7768155088ea2bb120", "ja": "わかりました。少しハードルが上がりましたが……\n春香と一緒に、楽しみながら頑張ってみます。", "zh": "明白了。虽然难度提高了一点……  \n但我会和春香一起，在享受其中的同时努力尝试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0424_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "61ccd5cc8a21e088790e919e3e4f5c9346a8b834329f6bffb37bec6f55251a34", "ja": "{$P$}に、自信をもって\nお見せできるような一枚が撮れるように……！", "zh": "为了拍出一张能自信地展示给{$P$}先生的照片……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
